<feed xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><title>News from Europe - Latest world headlines and daily news - France 24</title><subtitle type="html">FRANCE 24 explores events across Europe, including in the 27 member states of the European Union and the United Kingdom. Follow our on-the-ground reports, interviews and analyses of the events affecting social and political life on the Continent and Europe’s role in the world.</subtitle><id>https://www.france24.com/en/europe/rss</id><updated>2026-11-08T20:38:49Z</updated><author><name>rssync</name></author><link rel="self" href="rss" type="application/atom+xml" /><link rel="alternate" href="https://www.france24.com/en/europe/" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.france24.com/en/europe/rss" type="application/rss+xml" /><entry><title>The week in pictures: US midterms 'Blue Wave', French protests and Dakar Youth Olympics</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:adc3cebbb79bbeb95c246da02589d7547cea9c588dad69a8d4cb8059d8b7cd97</id><updated>2026-11-08T20:38:49Z</updated><published>2026-11-08T16:21:34Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.france24.com/en/europe/20261108-the-week-in-pictures-trump-midterms-debacle-french-protests-dakar-youth-olympics--c8336674c1f6.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.france24.com/en/europe/20261108-the-week-in-pictures-trump-midterms-debacle-french-protests-dakar-youth-olympics" /><summary type="html">From the Democratic Party's big wins in the US midterm elections to France's ongoing student-led protests and the first Olympic sports event held on African soil, FRANCE 24 looks back at some of the week's most striking images.</summary><category term="Europe" /></entry><entry><title>Poland in shock after 6 killed in Krakow far-right shooting</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:ffce900d82c8a3375c24b6b66ca7232a7ce62b03eacdf54f9cf2e782cb884895</id><updated>2026-11-08T20:37:55Z</updated><published>2026-11-08T14:21:18Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.france24.com/en/poland-in-shock-after-6-killed-in-krakow-far-right-shooting--b5967a40cc64.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.france24.com/en/poland-in-shock-after-6-killed-in-krakow-far-right-shooting" /><summary type="html">Poland on Sunday launched a terror probe into the mass shooting in Krakow the day before, in which six people were killed and many more were injured. Authorities have said that the 24-year-old suspect, who used a semi-automatic rifle in his killing spree, was “fascinated by far-right ideologies”. He is currently in critical condition in hospital. FRANCE 24 journalist Adrien Sariat reports from Poland.</summary></entry><entry><title>Mourning in Poland after mass shooting</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:c2718910934304cd891deb7bcab935f2bbc6645cd2bc5d95ad19abbd94abf7f4</id><updated>2026-11-08T20:37:55Z</updated><published>2026-11-08T14:18:48Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.france24.com/en/mourning-in-poland-after-mass-shooting--bd87f2f4ae08.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.france24.com/en/mourning-in-poland-after-mass-shooting" /><summary type="html">Poland has launched a terrorism investigation after a deadly shooting left six people dead and 16 injured. The 24-year-old Polish suspect was reportedly fascinated by far-right ideologies. Authorities are investigating the possible extremist motive as Krakow's main square remains sealed. Two days of national mourning have been declared for the victims.</summary></entry><entry><title>Europe will take part in US-mediated Ukraine talks in Abu Dhabi, French FM says</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:c28c259bab2b86da87c7ad66529ffa9c981819eba05d27d212e9bece43aed095</id><updated>2026-11-08T20:37:55Z</updated><published>2026-11-08T14:16:31Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.france24.com/en/europe/20261108-europe-will-take-part-us-mediated-ukraine-peace-talks-abu-dhabi-french-fm-says--c38c48e4c7c4.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.france24.com/en/europe/20261108-europe-will-take-part-us-mediated-ukraine-peace-talks-abu-dhabi-french-fm-says" /><summary type="html">France will participate in the upcoming Abu Dhabi peace talks on ending the Ukraine war, Foreign Minister Jean-Noël Barrot said Sunday, adding that Europeans will be represented at the summit. The talks will take place under US mediation on Tuesday and Wednesday.</summary><category term="Europe" /></entry><entry><title>Poland launches terrorism probe into mass shooting in Krakow</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:efc8a71ba6d2bec07a2d9952bea81ce0927599dfb4ba32f8549c37afc9fd86da</id><updated>2026-11-08T20:37:55Z</updated><published>2026-11-08T08:59:56Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.france24.com/en/europe/20261108-poland-launches-terrorism-probe-into-krakow-mass-shooting--608f97551b17.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.france24.com/en/europe/20261108-poland-launches-terrorism-probe-into-krakow-mass-shooting" /><summary type="html">Poland on Sunday launched a terror probe into the mass shooting in Krakow the day before, in which six people were killed and many more were injured. Authorities have said that the 24-year-old suspect, who used a semi-automatic rifle in his killing spree, was “fascinated by far-right ideologies”. He is currently in critical condition in hospital.</summary><category term="Europe" /></entry><entry><title>Gunman kills six in Krakow, three more bodies found at his house</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:0674b30e519aa92087aff26fbe80ccb3d1d0843b4afe8fc3504db585f2c5ea38</id><updated>2026-11-08T20:37:55Z</updated><published>2026-11-07T22:47:06Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.france24.com/en/gunmen-kills-six-in-krakow-three-more-bodies-found-at-his-house--dc06bdec4f54.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.france24.com/en/gunmen-kills-six-in-krakow-three-more-bodies-found-at-his-house" /><summary type="html">A chilling new discovery in Poland, where three bodies have reportedly been found inside the Krakow gunman's home. That's in addition to six people killed and sixteen wounded when the attacker opened fire in the city's historic square. Prime Minister Donald Tusk has now declared the shooting an act of terrorism, saying Poland has never experienced anything quite like it. The 25-year-old suspect, described by authorities as holding radical far-right views, was shot by police.</summary></entry><entry><title>Gunman who killed at least six in Krakow ‘fascinated’ by far-right ideologies, government says</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:7a18761be66790e422cc09a35b03bb0d9f26b475327d9a25ae00c23ef1366182</id><updated>2026-11-08T20:37:55Z</updated><published>2026-11-07T15:23:48Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.france24.com/en/europe/20261107-at-least-three-people-killed-shooting-in-polish-city-of-krakow-police-say--f51ffab85332.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.france24.com/en/europe/20261107-at-least-three-people-killed-shooting-in-polish-city-of-krakow-police-say" /><summary type="html">A gunman reportedly "fascinated by far-right ideologies" shot and killed at least six people and wounded more than a dozen in Krakow’s main market square on Saturday, Polish authorities said. Three more bodies were later found at the home of the gunman, who was wounded and taken into custody.</summary><category term="Europe" /></entry><entry><title>Russia launches massive strike on Kyiv</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:9dd7ee4d1f76c68f95c12296d16328537ecf7d64776092b6a5aa8f91f096375e</id><updated>2026-11-08T20:37:55Z</updated><published>2026-11-07T12:15:21Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.france24.com/en/video/20261107-russia-launches-massive-strike-on-kyiv-1--1213cd3ff896.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.france24.com/en/video/20261107-russia-launches-massive-strike-on-kyiv-1" /><summary type="html">As Ukraine prepares for another round of talks with Russia and the United States next week, Moscow has launched a massive overnight strike. At least five people were injured in Kyiv, where Russian missiles damaged residential and commercial buildings, forced the closure of a bridge over the Dnipro River and caused fresh power and water outages. Ophélie Jacobson reports.</summary></entry><entry><title>AI Data centres face growing backlash</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:aa61b9ace010c53ff8959bfe652cbb7e6b50f05697eaa0828a93f2fb769e64af</id><updated>2026-11-08T20:37:55Z</updated><published>2026-11-07T09:39:55Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.france24.com/en/ai-data-centres-face-growing-backlash--009b8f3b4c3d.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.france24.com/en/ai-data-centres-face-growing-backlash" /><summary type="html">Democrats are also calling for tighter regulation of AI data centres, a concern shared across Europe. In Amsterdam, several hundred activists occupied the site of a planned Microsoft data centre as part of a two-day protest taking place across the continent. Jennie Shin reports.</summary></entry><entry><title>Russia hits Kyiv and surrounding region in massive overnight strike</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:03be2b890d4225e5b94abb50eddc2346eb7f9796e1362be5f4e0d2b20cbce1c0</id><updated>2026-11-08T20:37:55Z</updated><published>2026-11-07T08:08:44Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.france24.com/en/europe/20261107-moscow-strikes-kyiv-as-ukraine-prepares-for-talks-with-russia-and-the-us--a1d6ff529852.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.france24.com/en/europe/20261107-moscow-strikes-kyiv-as-ukraine-prepares-for-talks-with-russia-and-the-us" /><summary type="html">Moscow ⁠carried out missile ​and drone attacks on Kyiv and the surrounding region overnight Friday to Saturday, targeting energy infrastructure and killing at least one person while wounding eight, authorities said. Russia recently stepped up air strikes on ​Ukraine, worsening living conditions for residents who have limited access to power and water.</summary><category term="Europe" /></entry><entry><title>Europe bomb hoaxes widen</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:ee0212fda6b7ea5b796e24e8c37d4e9d82345e80f5ece7c2d254d24066bd4919</id><updated>2026-11-08T20:37:55Z</updated><published>2026-11-06T21:22:24Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.france24.com/en/europe-bomb-hoaxes-widen--730544f3c51f.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.france24.com/en/europe-bomb-hoaxes-widen" /><summary type="html">The series of hoax bomb scares sent to several Irish media outlets and European airlines are likely part of a coordinated campaign of disruption, according to the Irish government. Dozens of commercial flights have been targetted by email with threats said to be over and above the typical hoax in specificty. Ireland's broadcaster RTE who's staff evacuated the premises this morning and several Italian airlines, say they received a mesage cliaming to be from a Russian extremist group calling itself the Fighters of the Male State, which denied its implication. France 24's Jean-Emile Jammine speaks to Eric Schouten, founder and CEO of Dyami Security Intelligence.</summary></entry><entry><title>What Trump’s midterms debacle could mean for US support for Ukraine</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:b45e2dd6d9f9bfb42e6d5fff11f8ff75d9cdf98fde56d5471aed4e97d9f9e3d1</id><updated>2026-11-08T20:37:55Z</updated><published>2026-11-06T18:49:19Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.france24.com/en/europe/20261106-what-trump-s-midterms-debacle-could-mean-for-us-support-for-ukraine--f6b7f8ab35b9.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.france24.com/en/europe/20261106-what-trump-s-midterms-debacle-could-mean-for-us-support-for-ukraine" /><summary type="html">The Republican Party's crushing defeat in midterm elections has left Ukrainian President Volodymyr Zelensky optimistic about future support for Kyiv and stronger transatlantic relations. But with US President Donald Trump retaining broad foreign policy powers, the Democratic majority in Congress may have limited scope to bring about substantial change.</summary><category term="Europe" /></entry><entry><title>Europe: What we know about the hoax bomb threats disrupting flights</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:d03f57390056b9dbb20287580449ea1f4832098b41da8e458d792d1e5c2f01c8</id><updated>2026-11-08T20:37:55Z</updated><published>2026-11-06T16:59:02Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.france24.com/en/europe-what-we-know-about-the-hoax-bomb-threats-disrupting-flights--25ae3c60f5c4.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.france24.com/en/europe-what-we-know-about-the-hoax-bomb-threats-disrupting-flights" /><summary type="html">Dozens of European flights have been disrupted this week after bomb threats were sent in to various airports, with fighter planes escorting many civilian aircraft after threats were called in mid-flight.</summary></entry><entry><title>British comedian Russell Brand found guilty of rape and three sexual assaults</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:247d43c8ba52e7411a22eb9c1987d97810e93e7d57276c4c88cc992bd8e1acbb</id><updated>2026-11-08T20:37:55Z</updated><published>2026-11-06T16:45:41Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.france24.com/en/video/20261106-british-comedian-russell-brand-found-guilty-of-rape-and-three-sexual-assaults--d4e81a215bb9.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.france24.com/en/video/20261106-british-comedian-russell-brand-found-guilty-of-rape-and-three-sexual-assaults" /><summary type="html">British comedian Russell Brand was on Thursday, November 5, found guilty of rape and three sexual assaults by a London jury, including for an incident involving a 16-year-old girl. He now faces "significant" prison time, according to the judge.</summary></entry><entry><title>'Trump is a very dangerous person for the world': EU's former top diplomat Josep Borrell</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:56cea9bbcd3e5c81d30ddbe1ca54ea62c8ea3ff6c6c1579b250e39f2b71a5ac1</id><updated>2026-11-08T20:37:55Z</updated><published>2026-11-06T16:44:19Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.france24.com/en/tv-shows/talking-europe/20261106-trump-is-a-very-dangerous-person-for-the-world-eu-s-former-top-diplomat-josep-borrell--cd806e19d5cf.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.france24.com/en/tv-shows/talking-europe/20261106-trump-is-a-very-dangerous-person-for-the-world-eu-s-former-top-diplomat-josep-borrell" /><summary type="html">In an interview with Talking Europe, the EU's former top diplomat Josep Borrell reacts to the Democrats' victory in the US midterm elections, warning that US President Donald Trump is still "a very dangerous person for the world".</summary><category term="Talking Europe" /></entry><entry><title>'Chaos within aviation industry' as European air traffic hit by bomb threats</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:3b250a71e5400b9155ca59f4ff90062765b6bf0de1d96449416bea5f74bcc31e</id><updated>2026-11-08T20:37:55Z</updated><published>2026-11-06T16:33:20Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.france24.com/en/video/20261106-chaos-within-aviation-industry-as-european-air-traffic-hit-by-bomb-threats--1efad497d22a.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.france24.com/en/video/20261106-chaos-within-aviation-industry-as-european-air-traffic-hit-by-bomb-threats" /><summary type="html">Officials across Europe reported a fresh slew of bomb threats against multiple flights on Friday, November 6, following a string of hoaxes that have caused flight diversions this week. Two broadcasters also received security threats, in a possible sign the menace was spreading beyond the skies. FRANCE 24's International Affairs Editor Rochelle Ferguson Bouyahi has more.</summary></entry><entry><title>Europe's crisis of discontent: Student and cost-of-living protests spread across EU</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:350cfad3212179cec981ee2aeb80c38e1e52d0fcd3afe6612b71d24b44fb0944</id><updated>2026-11-08T20:37:55Z</updated><published>2026-11-06T11:48:49Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.france24.com/en/tv-shows/talking-europe/20261106-europe-s-crisis-of-discontent-student-and-cost-of-living-protests-spread-across-eu--be302a79e1aa.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.france24.com/en/tv-shows/talking-europe/20261106-europe-s-crisis-of-discontent-student-and-cost-of-living-protests-spread-across-eu" /><summary type="html">A growing wave of discontent is sweeping across Europe. What began in France as student protests over deteriorating school conditions, teacher shortages and an education system under pressure has quickly grown into something much bigger: a groundswell of discontent over the rising cost of living, unaffordable housing and struggling public services.</summary><category term="Talking Europe" /></entry><entry><title>French 2027 presidential elections: Why Mélenchon is a Gen Z favourite</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:ec83a38b40ff4351b76d0a2d4b60d174cb7ec110870d1b23049db26c79b89c47</id><updated>2026-11-08T20:37:55Z</updated><published>2026-11-06T11:43:31Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.france24.com/en/french-2027-presidential-elections-why-melenchon-is-a-gen-z-favourite--dc081f93fca0.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.france24.com/en/french-2027-presidential-elections-why-melenchon-is-a-gen-z-favourite" /><summary type="html">Hard-left presidential candidate Jean-Luc Mélenchon is beloved by French youth, but also one of the country’s most controversial politicians. His encouragement of the youth protests sweeping through France months ahead of the presidential election has only made him more divisive. So, why is Mélenchon a Gen Z favourite? FRANCE 24's Gabrielle Nadler spoke to young supporters to find out.</summary></entry><entry><title>Death toll rises to 50 in Russian attack on aid distribution ‌point in Ukraine</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:896b4dbc0d7594c953281ca0476774fb44b80be5097215bb92b5add6ab977ebc</id><updated>2026-11-08T20:37:55Z</updated><published>2026-11-06T10:15:12Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.france24.com/en/europe/20261106-death-toll-rises-to-50-in-russian-attack-on-aid-distribution-point-in-ukraine--2f2934711988.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.france24.com/en/europe/20261106-death-toll-rises-to-50-in-russian-attack-on-aid-distribution-point-in-ukraine" /><summary type="html">The death toll from Russia's bombing of an aid ​distribution ‌point in ⁠Ukraine's southeastern Zaporizhzhia region on Monday ‌has risen to 50, Kyiv's Emergency Service said on Friday, making it ​one of the deadliest strikes ‌on civilians this year.</summary><category term="Europe" /></entry><entry><title>Mass protests sweep France as huge crowds demand higher wages</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:bfe99fb8da9a9ab732108ef5cb553a34261fa8949110fa0a90536888fd7a16a8</id><updated>2026-11-08T20:37:55Z</updated><published>2026-11-06T10:05:40Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.france24.com/en/video/20261106-mass-protests-sweep-france-as-huge-crowds-demand-higher-wages--503d9de967f8.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.france24.com/en/video/20261106-mass-protests-sweep-france-as-huge-crowds-demand-higher-wages" /><summary type="html">Hundreds of thousands of striking workers protested across France on Thursday, November 5, against the rising cost of living following weeks of youth-led demonstrations, with police firing tear gas as clashes broke out in some cities. FRANCE 24's Emily Boyle reports.</summary></entry><entry><title>'Sleazy', 'manipulative' and 'ruthless': Russell Brand convicted of rape, sexual assault</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:47b4cc3f3cae8c6d0796d251bd0758f15fe7fa839f4b8d48909183dcfb2eed59</id><updated>2026-11-08T20:37:55Z</updated><published>2026-11-06T09:53:13Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.france24.com/en/tv-shows/press-review/20261106-sleazy-manipulative-and-ruthless-russell-brand-convicted-of-rape-sexual-assault--f08604782aab.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.france24.com/en/tv-shows/press-review/20261106-sleazy-manipulative-and-ruthless-russell-brand-convicted-of-rape-sexual-assault" /><summary type="html">PRESS REVIEW – Friday, November 6: Italian, British, French and Bulgarian papers discuss the bomb threats that diverted multiple flights across Europe on Thursday. British papers discuss Russell Brand's rape and sexual assault conviction. Finally, kids in Hanoi chase tourists – not for money, but for vocabulary. Bonus: we learn a fun fact about chihuahuas.</summary><category term="Press Review" /></entry><entry><title>British comedian Russell Brand found guilty of rape, sexual assault</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:5aaadf07fd4ff060276b6b9de633a605cc967b35d314f0734b342e54edda6174</id><updated>2026-11-08T20:37:55Z</updated><published>2026-11-05T14:26:40Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.france24.com/en/europe/20261105-british-comedian-russell-brand-found-guilty-of-rape-sexual-assault--557036caf804.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.france24.com/en/europe/20261105-british-comedian-russell-brand-found-guilty-of-rape-sexual-assault" /><summary type="html">A London jury on Thursday convicted British comedian and actor Russell Brand of one count of rape and three counts of sexual assault.</summary><category term="Europe" /></entry><entry><title>France faces new protests as government seeks to prevent violence</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:67a510884da6fbbb8e03719f7bf2b5169146f1a86a5be7e416a74aaa045d5ae8</id><updated>2026-11-08T20:37:55Z</updated><published>2026-11-05T14:19:53Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.france24.com/en/france-faces-new-protests-as-government-seeks-to-prevent-violence--726573d2b4a2.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.france24.com/en/france-faces-new-protests-as-government-seeks-to-prevent-violence" /><summary type="html">France faces new protests as the government seeks to prevent a repeat of October unrest. Protesters demand better public services, including education, and also critique the rising cost-of-living. FRANCE 24's Claire Paccalin reports from the ground.</summary></entry><entry><title>French bank hit by cyberattack, hackers steal $100 million</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:243edab8e730dae8a94a5aa51eae146c88aadb4141831cca54b302e520438ca3</id><updated>2026-11-08T20:37:55Z</updated><published>2026-11-05T14:09:56Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.france24.com/en/cyberattack-french-bank-says-online-hacking-stole-around-100-million--5c60fc9f98d8.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.france24.com/en/cyberattack-french-bank-says-online-hacking-stole-around-100-million" /><summary type="html">French regional bank Crédit Mutuel Arkéa said Wednesday it had been hit by a cyberattack that led to fraudulent transfers worth around 100 million euros ($112 million). The bank said the attack, which has since been "contained", allowed hackers to access its own accounts and transfer funds to other banks. Customer accounts were not affected, and no losses were reported by clients.</summary></entry><entry><title>Multiple flights in Europe diverted because of bomb threats after earlier hoaxes</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:d4cf893096d59c477f9713d4309881008724ae04c9b67fc9a766dcb547f59068</id><updated>2026-11-08T20:37:55Z</updated><published>2026-11-05T12:52:44Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.france24.com/en/video/20261105-multiple-flights-in-europe-diverted-because-of-bomb-threats-after-earlier-hoaxes--b2bf07c03c94.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.france24.com/en/video/20261105-multiple-flights-in-europe-diverted-because-of-bomb-threats-after-earlier-hoaxes" /><summary type="html">Multiple flights in Europe made emergency landings on Thursday after being diverted because of bomb threats. The incidents followed hoax bomb threats earlier this week that prompted searches, diversions and in one case a military escort.</summary></entry><entry><title>Rome-bound plane diverted to French airbase as dozens European flights hit by bomb hoaxes</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:3fb767304671a7a3306105798c06f35b81c5787b2a2c8e28e626643a23f0d2f7</id><updated>2026-11-08T20:37:55Z</updated><published>2026-11-05T09:08:19Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.france24.com/en/europe/20261105-dublin-rome-flight-diverted-to-france-over-bomb-threat--74b4e74f0cc1.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.france24.com/en/europe/20261105-dublin-rome-flight-diverted-to-france-over-bomb-threat" /><summary type="html">An Aer Lingus ​flight from Dublin to Rome was diverted to France's Evreux airbase ​following a ‌bomb threat as some 25 flights were affected by a latest spate of hoax alerts. Threats against flights sent to airports in Rome and Sofia and seen by AFP claimed to be from "fighters of the Male State", a far-right Russian group.</summary><category term="Europe" /></entry><entry><title>European leaders welcome Democrats' US midterms election win</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:a2540632bafdd56a12a3b9ce5b612905d8606f7fcec6e1a4e6fcd5e585c2988c</id><updated>2026-11-08T20:37:55Z</updated><published>2026-11-04T17:00:09Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.france24.com/en/european-leaders-welcome-democrats-us-midterms-election-win--9eb298186d7f.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.france24.com/en/european-leaders-welcome-democrats-us-midterms-election-win" /><summary type="html">European leaders voiced hopes for a reset with the United States on Wednesday, November 4, after voters delivered a huge midterm election defeat to President Donald Trump and his Republican party. FRANCE 24's Dave Keating has more.</summary></entry><entry><title>What Trump’s midterms debacle could mean for US support for Ukraine</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:af3aaf5348b9359921775a0fc663104b3a610d93da6b95737e3943a71d9f070b</id><updated>2026-11-08T20:37:55Z</updated><published>2026-11-04T13:26:11Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.france24.com/en/video/20261104-ukrainian-s-not-expecting-drastic-change-in-us-policy-after-midterms-1--540065140edc.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.france24.com/en/video/20261104-ukrainian-s-not-expecting-drastic-change-in-us-policy-after-midterms-1" /><summary type="html">The Republican Party's crushing defeat in midterm elections has left Ukrainian President Volodymyr Zelensky optimistic about future support for Kyiv and stronger transatlantic relations. But with US President Donald Trump retaining broad foreign policy powers, the Democratic majority in Congress may have limited scope to bring about substantial change.</summary></entry><entry><title>Russian households face increasing financial strain as war in Ukraine drags on</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:d82e0fa4fef45e87c5d924fa85f05d929eda96571b298347ecfbbadabed86161</id><updated>2026-11-08T20:37:55Z</updated><published>2026-11-03T17:05:54Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.france24.com/en/video/20261103-russian-households-face-increasing-financial-strain-as-war-in-ukraine-drags-on--4000ebd21c3e.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.france24.com/en/video/20261103-russian-households-face-increasing-financial-strain-as-war-in-ukraine-drags-on" /><summary type="html">As Moscow continues to launch strikes across Ukraine, Russian citizens are facing increasing financial strain. Since the start of the war in 2022, utility bills in Russia have risen by more than 50% – over 13% this year alone. These rising costs come as the country grapples with ongoing drone attacks originating from Ukraine.</summary></entry><entry><title>Ukraine and Russia are taking the war underground as drones saturate the battlefield</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:e56ff3d1245ca13d0a42330c5f3c2f5470dc0ff6176c6c86947062fe2d7eccd2</id><updated>2026-11-08T20:37:55Z</updated><published>2026-11-03T16:52:13Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.france24.com/en/europe/20261103-ukraine-and-russia-are-taking-the-war-underground-as-drones-saturate-the-battlefield--10719a9e898a.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.france24.com/en/europe/20261103-ukraine-and-russia-are-taking-the-war-underground-as-drones-saturate-the-battlefield" /><summary type="html">Ukrainian President Volodymyr Zelensky last week heralded the success of Operation Veles, during which Kyiv sent troops deep into a disused gas pipeline in the Kupiansk region to confront Russian troops. These underground tactics, which Russian forces have been using for more than two years to slip past Ukrainian lines, are giving Kyiv a new strategy on the battlefield.</summary><category term="Europe" /></entry></feed>
